                else if (ptr == &mons[PM_ARCH_LICH] && !rn2(3)) {
                        otmp = mksobj(rn2(3) ? ATHAME : QUARTERSTAFF,
                                      TRUE, rn2(13) ? FALSE : TRUE);
                        if (otmp->spe < 2) otmp->spe = rnd(3);
                        if (!rn2(4)) otmp->oerodeproof = 1;
                        (void) mpickobj(mtmp, otmp);

with that rn(13) controlling whether mksobj() is passed the "can this
be randomly artifactified?" parameter. (Arch-liches could
theoretically get an artifact quarterstaff, were there any that could
be randomly generated (the Staff of Aesculapius can't).)

